# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Ward Restocking (92519), and from the 29-31 Hillsbrad guide (level tidy 2026-11-15):
# Infiltration (533, 535), Prison Break In (544), Stone Tokens (556), Key to the City (93680), and
# Hammerfall's chain (655, 672, 674, 675, 676, 677, Silky Sutures 97539).
# Left out: Lord Aliden Perenolde (507, 508) and WANTED: Baron Vardus (566): Perenolde (41) and
# Vardus (40) are two to three levels over players here (recorded at about 38), and the next
# Tarren Mill landing (forever/horde/40-50/05-the-hinterlands, at about 47) is a long detour for
# grey XP (its slice declined them). Foul Magics (671, 673): Tor'gan gives it in Hammerfall, and
# its Syndicate hold Northfold Manor by Thoradin's Wall, behind you on this visit; the second part
# is an elite group quest.

# Alterac and the second Arathi visit at 38-39 (the 2026-11-07 re-order): Strahnbrad and the
# Dalaran crater from Tarren Mill, then all of Hammerfall's quests in one visit, Arathi from west
# to east and back south-west to the Thandol Span for the Badlands.
#
# Level tidy (2026-11-15, players' recorded levels): Tarren Mill's 33-36 quests and Hammerfall's
# 32-36 chain used to come at 30-32 on the first Hillsbrad visit, two to five levels under them,
# with recorded deaths at the Dalaran crater, around Valik and at the Witherbark village. They come
# here now, where the route works Tarren Mill and Hammerfall anyway: Krusk's Infiltration opens
# Gol'dir on the same visit, Voidglare's Prison Break In and Key to the City open Dalaran Patrols,
# Bel'varil's Stone Tokens open Bracers of Binding, and Hammerfall's chains run straight on into
# Call to Arms (678), Guile of the Raptor (701) and Ward Restocking (92519, which needs Silky
# Sutures: #2411, #2378).
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar (where the previous guide ends) -> zeppelin to the Undercity (training) ->
# fly to Tarren Mill (bind) -> first loop: Valik on the road north, west along the foothills to the
# Dalaran crater, back to Tarren Mill for every hand-in -> second loop: north to Strahnbrad (Gol'dir),
# west across Alterac to the Dalaran ruins, hearth back to Tarren Mill -> east into Arathi: the
# Boulderfist camp, the Shards of Myzrael -> Hammerfall (flight path) -> Drywhisker Gorge and the
# Iridescent Shards -> the eastern circle -> the Witherbark trolls, raptors and spiders ->
# Hammerfall -> Boulderfist Hall, the Fleshstalkers and Go'shek Farm -> Hammerfall -> the outer
# and western circles -> the inner circle -> Faldir's Cove, from where the next guide crosses the
# Thandol Span into the Wetlands.
#
# Class training: the Undercity at the start for Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages
# and Warlocks (Hunters, Shamans and Druids trained on the way to Orgrimmar).
#
# Carried on: Trollbane (638) from Stranglethorn; Thundering Hearts (97985) from Thousand Needles,
# for Calder Gray on the Undercity stop; Martek the Exiled (1106) and Sunken Treasure (669) for
# later on the route.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  tip Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo).
  train class

step Calder Gray
  zone Undercity
  when onquest 97985
  tip Calder Gray stands in the Apothecarium.
  turnin 97985                        -- Calder Gray: Stormheart's heart from Thousand Needles

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.1,48.3 "Undercity flight master"
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill and Alterac

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Krusk, Magus Wordeen Voidglare and Keeper Bel'varil are inside the inn; Tallow stands outside it.
  accept 533                          -- Krusk, inside
  accept 544                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside
  accept 93680                        -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare: Key to the City, the Grimy Key is by the traitors
  accept 556                          -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside
  accept 676                          -- Tallow: for Drum Fel in Hammerfall, later in this guide
  buy 3703 x1 npc 2388                -- Southshore Stout, for Henchman Valik
  sethome "Tarren Mill"

step Henchman Valik
  when onquest 533
  when !complete 533
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Follow the road north out of Tarren Mill into the Alterac foothills: Valik waits by the Syndicate camp. He offers his errand only while you carry Krusk's Infiltration: hand him the stout at once, and his reward is the Syndicate Missive Krusk wants. A missive from the Syndicate here does the same: with one in your bags the guide passes Valik.
  accept 535
  turnin 535

step Syndicate missives
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Only if Valik's missive didn't come your way: the Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-34) around the camps west of the road carry missives too; about one in three drops one.
  collect 3601 quest 533

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip West along the foot of the hills, south of the road: a Kirin Tor Guard (55) walks that road from the north-east down into the traitors' camp.
  goto 22.0,93.5 "South of the Dalaran crater's camp"

step The Dalaran crater
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip From the south, walk up into the camp below the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together in the camp, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-33) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens: the ones on the camp's west side are furthest from the Guard's road.
  tip Careful: a Kirin Tor Guard (55) patrols the road that comes down into the camp from the north-east and walks right up to the traitors; he attacks the Horde on sight and has killed many players here. Watch for him, let him walk back up the road, then pull the traitors. Many of the camp's guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone. Arcane Sentries (55, elite) and Kirin Tor Enforcers (55) stand around the violet dome itself: keep to the camp below the rim.
  collect 3691 quest 544.1            -- Dermot
  collect 3689 quest 544.2            -- Ricter
  collect 3690 quest 544.3            -- Alina
  collect 3688 quest 544.4            -- Kegan Darkmar
  collect 279469 quest 93680.1 @16.4,89.3 map 1416 -- Grimy Key: an object to loot, by the traitors
  collect 3714 quest 556 @17.7,83.6 map 1416 -- Worn Stone Tokens, from the Shield Guards and Theurgists on the camp's west side

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 61.5,20.9 "Tarren Mill"

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east along the foothills to Tarren Mill: everything from the first loop is handed in inside the inn.
  turnin 533                          -- Krusk, inside
  accept 503
  turnin 556                          -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside
  accept 557
  turnin 544                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside
  turnin 93680                        -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare
  accept 545

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  goto 60.0,43.7 "Gol'dir"

step Gol'dir
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head north up the road past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Syndicate spies roam Strahnbrad, and the buildings hold many Syndicate mobs, mages among them.
  collect 3704 quest 503.1            -- Inside
  complete 503 @60.6,43.8 map 1416    -- Find where Gol'dir is held, on the top floor
  turnin 503                          -- Gol'dir, on the top floor
  accept 506
  note Krusk will offer Lord Aliden Perenolde (41, in his manor far up Lordamere Lake) for this: leave it, he is over your level.

step Old Dalaran Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip From Strahnbrad follow the road south-west to Gallows' Corner and on west to the ruins north of the Dalaran crater, along the lake shore. The Dalaran Summoners lead Elemental Slaves; the bracers drop from the slaves. Careful: Arcane Sentries (55, elite) and Kirin Tor Guards (55) guard the dome itself and attack the Horde: work the ruins' outer edge and don't go up to the dome.
  kill 2359 quest 545.2 @22.4,58.6 map 1416
  collect 3715 quest 557.1 @21.6,61.9 map 1416
  kill 2358 quest 545.1 @22.0,57.9 map 1416

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Hearth back to Tarren Mill: your hearthstone is bound there.
  hearth "Tarren Mill"
  turnin 506                          -- Krusk, inside
  turnin 557                          -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside
  turnin 545                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside
  note The magus offers a dungeon errand next: leave it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into Arathi

step Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  goto 32.6,40.4 "Arathi Highlands"

step Boulderfist camp
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Head east out of Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south of Northfold Manor; the Enforcers stay in the cave there.
  kill 2562 quest 676.1
  kill 2564 quest 676.2               -- Below ground

step The Shards of Myzrael
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Follow the road east. The violet shards glow just off the road a short way west of Hammerfall.
  turnin 635 optional
  accept 642

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammerfall

step Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate.
  tip Rutherford Twing offers the Defiler's Basic Care Package only once you are Friendly with the Defilers (Arathi Basin): skip it if he doesn't offer it.
  accept 655                          -- Gor'mul, by the gate
  getfp "Hammerfall"
  turnin 8263 direct optional
  turnin 638                          -- Zengu
  turnin 676                          -- Drum Fel
  accept 677
  turnin 655                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 672
  accept 97539                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate. If Doctor Gregory Victor offers nothing, another player may be running his First Aid quest Triage: he can be busy for a few minutes. Wait, then talk to him again.

step Stromgarde quests for a group
  when group 639
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Zengu's Sigil of Strom drops from the elite Syndicate (35-38) in Stromgarde's ruins, the west of the highlands. Great XP if you have a group for it: the route passes Stromgarde on its way to the inner circle.
  accept 639                          -- Zengu

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of Hammerfall

step Drywhisker Gorge
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael.
  tip Careful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them.
  collect 4435 quest 642

step Iridescent Shards
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Iridescent Shards lie at the far end of the gorge.
  turnin 642                          -- Below ground
  accept 651

step The Stone of East Binding
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Each Circle of Binding is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of Hammerfall.
  tip Careful: Each center stone is guarded by around three elementals near level 39 that attack together if you click the stone without clearing them: Burning Exiles at West, Thundering Exiles at Outer, Cresting Exiles at East.
  collect 4484 quest 651              -- Cresting Key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South of Hammerfall

step Witherbark Village
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip South of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village. Careful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps.
  kill 2556 quest 677.2
  kill 2554 quest 677.1
  kill 2555 quest 677.3

step Highland raptors and Plains Creepers
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip On the way back north, Highland Striders roam the hills all around Hammerfall and drop the eyes, and south of it the Plains Creepers (32-33) spin their webs in the grass; they carry the spidersilk.
  collect 4512 quest 672
  collect 278225 quest 97539 @69.5,50.5 map 1417 -- Surgical Spidersilk, from Plains Creepers

step Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Back north to Hammerfall: the doctor stands at the south gate.
  turnin 97539                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate. If he won't take the silk, another player may be running Triage: wait a few minutes and talk to him again.
  accept 92519                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate
  turnin 672                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 674
  turnin 674                          -- Gor'mul
  accept 675
  turnin 675                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 701
  turnin 677                          -- Drum Fel
  accept 678

step Boulderfist Hall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall, far south-west of Hammerfall; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 2566 quest 678.1
  kill 2567 quest 678.2

step Fleshstalker raptors
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Highland Fleshstalkers (36-37) hunt the southern highlands, a pack north of Boulderfist Hall and another on the plain to its west. Pull them one at a time.
  collect 4513 quest 701

step Go'shek Farm
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Apothecary Jorell's lab shack stands at Go'shek Farm, north-east of the raptors' plain on the way back to Hammerfall; the case of Packaged Tonics is inside.
  collect 278462 quest 92519 @60.1,59.3 map 1417 -- Packaged Tonics

step Back to Hammerfall
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Back north-east to Hammerfall.
  turnin 92519                        -- Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate
  turnin 701                          -- Tor'gan
  accept 702
  turnin 678                          -- Drum Fel
  turnin 702                          -- Gor'mul, by the gate
  accept 847
  turnin 847                          -- Tor'gan
